MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The portable hard drive fits my repeated use of camera memory cards and a card reader because it would give me a place to collect and back up photos.",
    "A larger Fire tablet is a plausible upgrade from my Fire 7 for viewing photos and videos, and a streaming stick would add a useful viewing option alongside my TV and DVD player."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo displays, speaker, and smart plug assume I want voice assistance or home automation, but my purchases have mostly addressed specific storage, charging, mounting, and viewing needs.",
    "The internal SSD requires a compatible computer and an upgrade plan I do not currently have; the portable drive fits my backup needs more directly. The earbuds also do not address a current need."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning a Fire tablet seems to have been taken as interest in many Alexa devices, although I value the tablet for its portable screen.",
    "My memory-card purchases seem to have been interpreted as interest in any storage device, without enough attention to how I would connect and use it."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated purchases of cards, readers, tripods, and a lens cap suggest that accessories supporting my existing photography equipment remain relevant.",
    "I often buy items with a specific connection or practical purpose, so compatibility and a clear use matter. Both streaming sticks fit the same need, but I would choose only one."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly understood my photo-storage and viewing needs but stretched my Fire tablet ownership into an unsupported interest in Alexa and home automation."
}
